   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Additional funding for the last activities, September-December 1998, within a project of cooperation between Stockholm and St Petersburg University. The objective has been to develop and modernize the the university administration in St Petersburg and to strengthen the education in public adminstration.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Avslutande av ett samarbetsprojekt mellan Stockholms och St  Petersburgs universitet, september-december 1998. Syftet har varit att utveckla och modernisera universitetsadministrationen i St Petersburg och att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra utbildningen i offentlig administration.</narrative>
